Title: Scan log lines name the brand; the run resolves the --reasoning-effort parameter
Why: Logs said 'Strix scan ... done'. Also: the --reasoning-effort run parameter (scan_config) overrides the configured effort and force-sends it for catalog-unknown models (strix/jitera/reasoning.py).
Upstream-PR: none

